    why: ["Correct. Alabama's enslaved population rose from about 42,000 in 1820 to about 343,000 in 1850, and Mississippi's from about 33,000 to about 310,000.", "Virginia's figure stayed between about 412,000 and 454,000.", "In 1850 Mississippi had about 310,000 enslaved people and Virginia about 452,000.", "Alabama's figure more than doubled from 1830 to 1840 and kept rising."],
