    why: ["Correct. Virginia's enslaved population barely grew while the Deep South's soared, because Upper South owners sold hundreds of thousands of people south and west, splitting families.", "This is reversed: the 1808 ban on imports made the domestic trade more valuable.", "This runs the trade backward; people were sent from Virginia to the Deep South.", "The Northern states had ended slavery, so the trade did not go there."],
